                                                "sense_id": "398065de-aa54-364d-b665-62cdc2a9d6b0",
                                                "text": "The impartial observer of mankind is compelled to acknowledge that anger is the bane of society, the introducer of discord into the families of rich and poor, the disjoiner of friendships, the destroyer of conjugal and domestic bliss."
                                            }
